IntentExecutionPolicy::setWhitelistedTarget
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when adding a target
│   │   ├── it should set whitelistedTargets[target] to true
│   │   └── it should emit TargetWhitelisted(target, true)
│   └── when removing a target
│       ├── it should set whitelistedTargets[target] to false
│       └── it should emit TargetWhitelisted(target, false)
└── given caller is not owner
    └── it should revert
